	(text_box "LAYOUT NOTE: CONNECTORS\n1. J1/J4 (daisy) at board edge beside their transformers; TH pins ->\n   inner-plane keep-out >= 3 mm.\n2. J2 taps / J3 temps on the edge facing the blocks.\n3. Tab fuses at CELL END of tap harness, >= 67.2 V rated (FSAE EV.8.4.3).\n4. Verify pin 1 / row numbering on each Molex drawing."
